//! Raw FFI bindings to the PDFium fork.
//!
//! Generated by `bindgen` 0.72.1 over the same fork headers that
//! `packages/engine/runtime/build/generate-functions.mjs` walks, with the same
//! `FPDF|EPDF|FORM|PDFiumExt_` symbol filter. The generated file gets included
//! here:
//!
//! ```ignore
//! include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/bindings.rs"));
//! ```
//!
//! The prototype's 21 hand-written declarations were a sysroot workaround and
//! are not carried over.
//!
//! Group G0 (multiplatform-port-order.md). Replaces
//! `packages/engine/runtime/src/core/pdf-functions.generated.ts`.
